  description: 'Add a Hypnotize stack to the enemy. Each stack gives it a 20% chance
    to attack itself instead of you (that hit deals 50% of its normal damage). When
    it hits itself, the stacks reset and it can''t be hypnotized for 2 turns. Mana
    cost: 100.'
